": "place_order", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I placed a single purchase order, PO0001, for the new hires, shipping to HQ.\n\n- **3 \u00d7 DK-210** (USB-C Dock, successor to DK-200): $199 each, $597\n- **3 \u00d7 MN-27** (27-inch 4K Monitor): $329 each, $987\n- **Total: $1,584**\n\nThe DK-200 was not available as new equipment. The catalog only listed the refurbished DK-200-R, so I substituted the approved successor DK-210, which is new. Both items are new, not refurbished. The total is under the $2,500 threshold, so no manager approval was needed.", "type": "text"}]}]}